window.products.push({"id":365131,"name":"TBC Treasure Gurus 9' Fishing Net Floats on Nautical Rope Bobber Garland Wood Buoy Beach Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gLaWLqkOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This is the perfect Nautical addition to your next Beach Party or Luau! Seventeen old style wooden bobbers, each with thier own unique pattern and shape, decorate this 9' Rope Garland. Beautifully Crafted to appear weathered, you can use these as decor for your beach home, your patio, poolside deck, or even as a nautical Christmas decoration. This 9' Fishing Rope features 17 wood buoy net floats, each about 1\"-4\" in length, hanging on a 9' Fishing Rope, and would make the perfect, unique gift for those who love fishing or the beach. The 9' Nautical Bobber Garland ships brand new with out 100% customer satisfaction guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gLaWLqkOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TBC","source_asin":"B0151QT3QO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365131","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0151QT3QO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0151QT3QO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":365132,"name":"Aroma Space Lively Breeze Ceramic Diffuser Set- Mochi Bunny (Pink)& Moroccan Rose Home Fragrance","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EMTjVf5uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ceramic fragrance diffuser gift set for room scenting and decoration.  Once open the box, you will find one set of ceramic diffuser and one bottle of 60 ml diffuser fragrance (in PET bottle)  Usage: 1. Simply pour the diffuser fragrance into the base. 2. Insert the ceramic diffuser. 3. Place the ceramic diffuser set on a secure, flat surface. (avoid placing the diffuser directly on a painted or synthetic surface without a protective tray). 4. Leave the ceramic diffuser to absorb up the fragrance and gradually diffuse the scent Tips:  - One set of ceramic diffuser is suitable for room size 9-15 Sqm.  - 60 ml fragrance will be diffused for around 1 month but the scent will remain on the ceramic for about 2 months.  - For use with Essential oil, simply drip 6-12 drops of essential oil on top of the ceramic. Add more oils once the scent is faded. - If you wish to use the ceramic diffuser with a new scent, simply clean the ceramic with liquid soap and clean water, then let it dry before filling new fragrance. Ceramic size: W 7 x L 7 x H 9 cm, Fragrance size: 60 ml / 2.05 oz, Gift box size: W 8.5 x L 13.5 x H 14 cm Hand-made ceramic from Thailand. Packed in kraft paper gift box with usage instruction. Moroccan Rose fragrance (alcohol-free formula) has sweet floral and woody notes which will give you a sweet and refreshing ambience","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EMTjVf5uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aroma","source_asin":"B01HEWTZQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365132","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HEWTZQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HEWTZQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":365133,"name":"Bush Furniture Somerset 72W Office Desk with Drawers in Fresh Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h8PkkS-oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your home office with the Bush Furniture Somerset 72W Office Desk with Drawers, the perfect addition to your workspace. This long desk is designed to provide a spacious and efficient work area for all your office needs, with an expansive 72-inch work surface that offers plenty of space to spread out with a computer and paperwork. The home office desk's built-in storage is also a great bonus, with a file drawer that opens smoothly on full-extension ball bearing slides, providing easy access to your legal and letter size documents. A box drawer is also included, which provides storage for all your office supplies and utensils, keeping them organized and within reach. The desk's wire management grommet conveniently keeps cords and cables out of sight, while a fully finished back side allows the desk to look great no matter where it's positioned in the room. The desk can also be configured to your preference, with the option of mounting the drawers on either side for a custom setup that fits your needs. The Somerset 72W Office Desk with Drawers features transitional styling with tapered leg accents and contemporary metal hardware, making it a modern desk that works with virtually any decor. This desk is tested to meet ANSI/SOHO quality standards for safety and performance, so you can work with confidence knowing that it's built to last. For an even more ergonomic workspace, pair the desk with the coordinating Somerset 42W 3 position sit to stand return (sold separately), which allows you to adjust the height of your workspace for added comfort. The Bush Furniture Somerset collection offers a wide range of products to expand your home or small office with sophisticated style. Upgrade your workspace with the Bush Furniture Somerset 72W Office Desk with Drawers, the large desk that combines functionality and style for a workspace that works for you. Backed by the Bush Furniture 6 year manufacturer's warranty, this desk is an investment in your productivity and comfort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h8PkkS-oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B0BXST7GWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365133","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXST7GWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXST7GWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
