window.products.push({"id":365225,"name":"XYJ Asian Vegetable Cleaver Meat Knife 7 Inch Full Tang Stainless Steel Finger Hole Knife Blade Butcher Chopping Meat Fish Vegetables Ergonomic Wood H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LOvBWMnKS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔪【Premier Asian meat knife】 The Asian vegetable cleaver adopts high-quality stainless steel, not easy to rust. The super sharp V-blade enables smooth and clean cuts for the long term. The hole in the blade can let your index finger pass through and hold it tight, thus it’s more effort-saving 🔪【Full tang ergonomic wood handle】 The full tang pakka wood handle is triple-riveted, allowing you to use it for years to come. Ergonomically design provides a comfortable grip and agile control. There are holes on the blade and at the end of the handle for easy hanging on the shelf 🔪【Non-stick hammered blade】 Hammered finish blade surface can reduce the contact between the blade and food. Adopting stonewash process, the chopper knife blade surface is tough, wear-resistant, and it’s not obvious even there are scratches 🔪【Design for multipurpose】 The Chinese chef knife can be used to chop, slice, dice, mince vegetables, meat, fish, fruit, etc. Suitable for both right and left hands 🔪【Ideal gift idea】 Come with a mini whetstone, which will help you resharpen the blade and restore the sharpness after using the knife for a long time. Well packed in a gift box, a great gift for kitchen enthusiasts to enjoy food preparations","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LOvBWMnKS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XYJ","source_asin":"B0963KLR58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0963KLR58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0963KLR58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":365226,"name":"Antallcky Star Cookie Cutter Set-5 pcs Stainless Steel Five-pointed Star Biscuit Molds Fondant Cake Cookie Cutter Set Pastry Mold-for 3d Christmas Tre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DKQ7IWn-L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM STAINLESS STEEL: all 100% commercial 18/8 304 stainless steel double thickness compared with the similar products in market, so they are strong enough to keep their shape, are rust proof,dishwasher safe and tested to be oven safe to 500F degrees.Food Grade,Non-toxic, environment-friendly,non stick and easy clean, safe to use. More Choice: 5 different sizes of star stainless steel cookie cutters,diameters from small to large are 1.6\",2.4\", 3.2\", 3.9\",4.6\" and depth are 1in(2.5cm).So you can choose 1 to make star or 2 to make annulus(linzer) cookies.Perfect for making star &annulus(linzer) cookies,fruits,vegetables, fondant,bread,sandwiches,cheese,craft clay or others. GREAT FOR FRUITS, VEGGIES, AND CHEESE: These incredibly sharp one-sided cutters are made of heavy-duty materials that cut easily through fruits, vegetables, and hard cheeses. Use these cutters to create beautiful platters or stack them for a breathtaking fruit or vegetable tower presentation. MAKE PERFECTLY STAR PASTRIES: No more misshapen cookies! Their rims have been double-sharpened so that the dough slips easily off the cutter for the pan and maintains a sharp, clean edge. This will prevent any warping of the dough, ensuring that the dough remains perfect, professional stars. DISHWASHER SAFE: Never wash a dish! Due to the premium stainless steel used in manufacturing this product, these cutters are perfectly safe for running through the dishwasher, saving you the most time-consuming and annoying part of baking – the cleanup. Made of 18/8 304 premium stainless steel, these ring cutters will not rust, and that’s a guarantee.Dishwasher safe and tested to be oven safe to 500F degrees. Versatile: As food molds,you could use them in cakes,cookies,fondant,scone,pastries,dough, English, bread,toast. As craft,you could use them in clay,soap. As ornament,you could hang them on christmas tree,wall or others to decorate your home. Besides daily use,it is suitbale for any celebration or party,such as birthday,wedding,Christmas,New Year,Thanksgiving Day,Mother's Day,Father's Day,Flag Day,Independence Day,Halloween,Valentine's Day and etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DKQ7IWn-L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Antallcky","source_asin":"B07N5HBB91","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N5HBB91","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N5HBB91","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
