window.products.push({"id":365425,"name":"AIZIBLISH Cervical Pillow, Neck Pillows for Pain Relief Sleeping, Orthopedic Side Sleeper Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Pain, Contour Memory Foam Pillo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mlPdZzs2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【The Most Effective Cervical Pillow】 Our orthopaedic pillows are ergonomically shaped, combining a neck support pillow and contour neck pillow designed to keep your head, neck, back, shoulders and spine aligned, minimizing cervical pressure. AIZIBLISH back and side sleeper cervical neck pillow, helping to relieve neck and back pain, allowing you wake up refreshed. 【Away From Neck & Shoulder Pain】 Pillows play a crucial role in neck pain, our contour cervical pillow conform to the curve of the neck, keeping the neck relaxed all the times, and the unique slope holds the neck in a stable position, helping to gently stretch and relieve your shoulder muscles while supporting the neck, release fatigue and improve blood circulation, helping you sleep through the night without pain. 【High-Quality Memory Foam Neck Pillow】The ergonomic sleeping pillow core is made of high-density, slow-rebound memory foam, with the perfect balance of softness and support for maximum comfort, keeping their shape and support even with long-term use, without deforming throughout the year. The neck pillows for pain relief sleeping are both Certified by CertiPUR-US and Oeko-Tex, you can invest with confidence. 【2 Heights in A pillow for Different Sleeper】 Say \"good night\" to neck pain with our neck contour pillow. The pillows for neck pain sizes 25.4*13.6*2.8/4.5\" (L x W x H) with two levels of neck support so you can choose the height that better suits your sleeping position. Simply rotate your bed pillow 180 degrees, you can enjoy a higher or lower contour, the higher side is ideal for side sleeping, and the lower side is ideal for sleeping on your back. 【Cooling Pillowcase & Breathable Pillow】 The side sleeper pillow for neck and shoulder pain is made of super comfortable breathable ice fiber fabric and mesh sides, allow for keeping ventilation and airflow throughout the cervical neck pillow, keeping you cool and comfortable all night. Removable, machine washable. whether you prefer comfort, coolness or extra support for your cervical pillow, this cervical pillow for neck pain can meet your needs. 【Perfect Care Gift Choice】 This memory foam cervical pillow is appropriate for elderly, office workers, students and all ages people. So you can confidently choose this Cervical Pillow to friends lovers and family as a gift. AIZIBLISH neck support pillow provides a 100-day no-questions-asked refund policy for all our customers.If you do not enjoy this pillow for neck pain, no matter refund or replace, no question asked, you will get the solution at once！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mlPdZzs2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIZIBLISH","source_asin":"B0BCP49XKZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCP49XKZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCP49XKZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
