window.products.push({"id":365459,"name":"Fagor 4-Piece 8-Quart Multipot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rmZiOmw3L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Product Description Boil pasta or potatoes or a batch of spaghetti sauce in this Fagor Commercial 8-qt. Multipurpose Pot. Features 18/10 brushed stainless steel with an aluminum encapsulated bottom for even heat distribution; round riveted handles for easy handling; pasta steamer insert; vegetable steam insert; and tempered glass lid. Recipe book included. Hand wash. Imported. 8-qt. capacity. Amazon.com Save precious storage space in your kitchen with this multi-purpose pot from Fagor. Constructed of durable 18/10 stainless steel and brushed to a contemporary finish, the eight-quart pot is the perfect size for large batches of soup, stew, and chili, not to mention stovetop popcorn. With the pasta insert in place, you can lift and drain your cooked pasta with ease, doing away with a colander. Place the steamer basket with its swing handle in the top of the pot for healthy cooking of broccoli, asparagus, and other vegetables. The tempered glass lid vents steam as it lets you monitor what's cooking. Safe to use on any type of burner, including induction, the multipot is dishwasher-safe and carries a limited one-year warranty. A recipe book is also included. Founded in Spain, Fagor manufactures home appliances and cookware with a \"green\" focus on environmentally-sound working conditions for employees and energy efficiency for consumers. In Europe, Fagor holds environmental stewardship awards, and in the U.S. is a participant in the Energy Star program, a government-backed program to help protect the environment. One of the company's most popular products is the pressure cooker, which is gaining momentum as a healthy, time-saving, and energy-saving method of cooking for today's lifestyles. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box : 8-quart multipot. The pot set consists of: 8-quart stock pot; tempered glass lid; pasta insert; steamer basket insert. 4 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rmZiOmw3L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fagor","source_asin":"B00008UA65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00008UA65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00008UA65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
