window.products.push({"id":365537,"name":"OVOS Vegetable Spiral Slicer Pasta Maker Noodle Spiralizer Stainless Steel Blades With Ceramic Peeler Brush Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lM3kUc73L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for the best handheld spiralizer, look no further! This vastly improved model corrects the problems found with the older models, which are known to be uncomfortable and difficult to use. With its improved ergonomic design, our handheld spiralizer is safer, sleeker and far more comfortable to hold. You deserve the very BEST! Features and Benefits: - Beautifully slices, spiralizes and cuts firm fruits and vegetables - including carrots, zucchinis, cucumbers and more! - Easy self-contained storage: Safe to operate and easy to clean: dish-washer safe too! - Quickly and easily adjust the size of the spirals: includes 2 rust-free stainless steel blades: forever sharp and never rusts! - Made from premium quality, 100% BPA free, food grade safe, durable reinforced ABS plastic: won't bend or crack! - Non-electric, small kitchen gadget: easy to store away and ideal for camping. What's inside the box - Handheld Vegetable Spiralizer Spiral Slicer (includes finger safety cap) - Vegetable cutter with 2 cutters - FREE Ceramic Peeler - for those who don't want the skin on! - FREE Flexible Cleaning Brush - helps remove the pieces that get stuck! HOW TO USE -Remove the cap from the OVOS spiral slicer -Choose your blade! Grip the green, plastic blade guide. Pull away from the slicer body. Turn to align the blade of your choice and then reattach.  -Place the vegetable into the center of the slicer cone. With firm pressure, twist the vegetable for perfect noodles.  -Use the cap when the vegetable gets very short to minimize wastage.  -After use, simply rinse under running water. Use supplied brush to remove vegetable residue. Dishwasher safe! For best results, use firm, large vegetables that easily fit into slicer. Click on \"Add To Cart\" button at the top to experience the healthy lifestyle of using Envy Spiral Slicer TODAY !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lM3kUc73L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OVOS","source_asin":"B01H6R1CWE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H6R1CWE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H6R1CWE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
