window.products.push({"id":365550,"name":"BLUEDEEP 190 Pints Commercial Dehumidifier with 6.56ft Drain Hose and 1.75 Gallon Water Reservoir, Water Damage Restoration Dehumidifier, for Basement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":549.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ETC4Y8ZSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ [ 190 pint High-efficiency Dehumidification ] BLUEDEEP commercial dehumidifier can removal 190PPD at saturation, 90 pints per day at AHAM, up to 6000 sq. Ft, lowering the humidity to comfortable levels in a short period of time. On the other hand, this basement dehumidifier is made of a metal outer casing that withstands more rugged conditions, ensuring long-term use and easy maintenance. Fit any crawl spaces, basements, warehouses, offices, factories, shops, storage areas. ✅ [ Auto Defrosting System ] The auto defrost is important, as ice buildup on the dehumidifier’s coils can cause the units to malfunction. BLUEDEEP commercial dehumidifier can truly make the crawl spaces dehumidifier able to work at the Low temperature (41 degrees Fahrenheit), making the unit work continuously and efficiently without periodic stopping during the defrosting process, not only saving the energy but also making the unit last longer. ✅ [ Ultra-quiet & Intelligent Touch Panel ] A large touch-pad LED control panel offers great convenience for wind speed key, mode key, timing key, child lock key, power button, humidity status display description. The dehumidifier can also be controlled remotely via a remote control. A quiet fan won't disturb you when you sleep or work. Simply set the ideal humidity level and the dehumidifier will intelligently sense the humidity in the room and maintain your preset humidity level. ✅ [ Convenient Drainage Options ] Two drainage methods are provided for you. You can detach and remove the bucket to empty the 8L (2.08 Gal) reservoir, or enable continuous drain only via a 3.3 ft drain hose (included) for peace of mind. The visible water level of the tank enables you to know the water amount at a glance. The detachable filter allows you to remove and wash it. CAUTION: When you drain with water tank, Please tighten the switch at the water pipe to avoid water leakage. ✅ [ 1 Years Warranty ] Every BLUEDEEP commerical dehumidifier comes with a 1-year warranty with a professional customer support team ready to assist at any time. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, you deserve the best after-sales service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ETC4Y8ZSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLUEDEEP","source_asin":"B0C3RLXQNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365550","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3RLXQNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3RLXQNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
