window.products.push({"id":365768,"name":"Precious Moments Santa Riding Bike Ornament, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Oyxp0yFnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The blessed Nativity is the reason we celebrate each December, the Christmas story both inspires and humbles us as we reflect upon the greatest gift mankind has been given. This design interprets that Holy Night upon a snowy background. A Star of Wonder shines overhead as the newborn king rests silently. Inspired by the artwork of Kitt Wichmann, Ne’Qwa Art artisans recreate the image of His miraculous birth. Includes a Certificate of Authenticity. Beautifully packaged in a satin-lined, keepsake gift box, this ornament is a perfect Christmas gift for friends, family, or coworkers this holiday season. It also makes a memorable gift for hostesses or newlyweds. It can also be offered as a housewarming gift that will be treasured every year! An adjustable tasseled cord allows for display on a Christmas tree or a stand. Measures approximately 3”H. Petite Marquis shape. All genuine Ne’Qwa Art ornaments and gifts are created with the ancient technique of hand-painting original art on the inside of mouth-blown glass. With meticulous attention to every detail, trained artisans use specially designed paintbrushes to re-create stunning works of original art. Make memories to treasure for a lifetime with authentic Ne’Qwa Art glass ornaments and gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Oyxp0yFnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Precious Moments","source_asin":"B084XSRGLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365768","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084XSRGLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084XSRGLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
