window.products.push({"id":365798,"name":"Manicer Blacklight Skull Tapestry, The Kissing Lovers Tapestry UV Reactive Trippy Neon Tapestries Glow in the Dark Party Backdrop, Skeleton Wall Art f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kN0sqoATL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Lightweight Polyester Imported 💀UV/Black Light Reactive💀 Good graphic design alone is not enough to make an impressive tapestry. With special ink and advanced print tech, we proudly make this UV / black light reactive tapestry. When the night come, just turn on your UV / black light and it will glow go. 💀Premium Material💀 This trippy skull tapestry is made of 100% high-quality lightweight polyester fabric with hand-sewn finishes which is super soft, durable and skin-friendly, do not fade. 💀Perfect Sizes💀 We currently have 4 sizes for your choice: 29.5\" x 39.4\" (75cm x 100cm) & 51.2” x 59.1” (130cm x 150cm) & 59.1\" x 80\" (150cm x 200cm) & 70.9\" x 90.6\" (180cm x 230cm). Choose the ideal size of this aesthetic tapestry as you like and let it be the best choice to change your room! 💀Multi-Purpose💀 This skeleton tapestry is usually be used as indoor and outdoor wall decor posters, party backdrop. It’s also perfect for wall hanging, sofa cover, bedspread, table cloth, picnic blanket, beach towels, ceilings, yoga mats and so on. We’ll also present you a pack of hanging accessories as a gift including 2 traceless thumbtacks, 2 metal clips, 2 mounting tapes which will make you easy to hang, fold up and pack away. It’ll definitely be a nice gift for your friends or family! 💀Easy Wash & Care💀 Dry Cleaning or gentle hand wash in cold water. Do not bleach, iron or use hard detergent. Hang dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kN0sqoATL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Manicer","source_asin":"B09P1B2PPJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P1B2PPJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P1B2PPJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":365799,"name":"Bodum 1913-340B-Y19 French Press Coffee Maker, glass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51i14bop9xL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Derived from the famous iconic BODUM CHAMBORD design, the CAFFETTIERA series embodies the motto of the brand: a beautiful design must be functional and accessible - Jorgen BODUM. Made from heat resistant borosilicate glass (up to 350 degrees), a unique chrome metal frame that protects the glass and acts as a stand, and a plastic lid, this coffee maker has been made for over 40 years by expert craftsmen in our BODUM factory in Portugal. All metal parts undergo numerous surface treatments during manufacture, which gives them a unique shine for many years of intensive use. The matt polypropylene handle is not only ergonomic and functional, it gives a colourful character to this coffee maker with a resolutely young and modern look. Recognised as one of the best ways to brew coffee by roasters worldwide, the FRENCH PRESS BODUM Piston Coffee Maker brews your coffee to perfection to extract maximum aromas and essential oils (ideal brewing time: between 4 and 5 minutes). For a rich and balanced and coffee (no paper filters, no potholders). Expert advice: using freshly ground coarse coffee and adding purified water with a temperature of between 92 and 96 degrees, you will get the best result and a coffee to taste simply sublime. Note: Qty of coffee produced is equal to 3 espresso cups.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51i14bop9xL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B07QKP8W3S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QKP8W3S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QKP8W3S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":365800,"name":"Venture Heat 3 Speed Wearable Cooling Fan Vest - Air Conditioning Battery Powered Portable Work Wear (3XL/4XL, Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XHAeUfApL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌪️ BUILT IN FAN: Cool down with our unique removable fan that moves fresh air along the back and shoulder blades 🔆 HOT DAY RELIEF: Special mesh moves air efficiently throughout the vest to dissapate heat and evaporate sweat away from the body ⚡ BATTERY POWERED: 3 fan settings - max, medium, low. A 5000 mAh USB battery can provide a runtime of 10 hours (low), 8 hours (medium), 6 hours (max). Vest is also compatible with most larger capacity USB power banks. 🦺 NO PUFF OR BULK: Vest stays slim even when fan is on. Choose between reflective high visibility (hi vis) or a subtle gray. Adjustable side straps. Suitable for work, contruction, gardening, hiking, walking, running ✔ 1 Year Warranty. Designed in USA. 100% USA based customer support since 2003.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XHAeUfApL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Venture Heat","source_asin":"B084ZZ7D1Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365800","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084ZZ7D1Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084ZZ7D1Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
