window.products.push({"id":365882,"name":"Isaac Jacobs 5x7 Vintage Style Octagon Brass & Glass, Metal Floating Picture Frame with Locket Closure (Vertical), Tabletop Display, (Fits up to a Cut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qzib53TvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Isaac Jacobs Vintage Style Octagon Brass & Glass frame captures the beauty in everyday photos and portrait shots and puts them charmingly on display. There is something special in the antique-inspired detail of the octagon shape of the frame. The chic design of the beautiful black metal edges surrounding the pressed glass panes, enhances any desk or countertop you place it on. Before inserting a photo, make sure you check the dimensions of this octagon frame! Due to the unique shape, a full-size 5” x 7” photo will have its corners cut off. [Note: The photo sizes that fit this frame are 4” x 6”, 2” x 6”, 5” x 5”, & 3.5” x 5”.] The beauty in this frame is the simple elegance in its design. The vintage-looking locket closure opens easily. Gently slide up the bar to raise the clasp before inserting a photo. Slide down to securely close. The classic look and simple functionality of the locket closure completes this modern frame’s vintage charm. Feel like you’re unlocking your own history when you display family photos and keepsakes inside this unique frame. The timeless appeal of this elegant frame makes it an ideal choice to display the big events in life, like weddings, birthdays, & graduations. These chic frames make for excellent centerpieces at wedding receptions. Show off your baby’s cuteness at a baby-naming ceremony. Pressed flowers and thin keepsakes will find a decorative home inside the glass panes and black metal edges. We spend so much time flipping through images on screens all day, it feels good to see our memories and passions preserved in style. [Notes: (1) This vertical frame cannot be displayed horizontally (2) This frame is not wall-mountable]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qzib53TvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B08H8VV4N8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H8VV4N8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H8VV4N8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
