window.products.push({"id":365948,"name":"BELLA 13577 12-Piece Rocket Blender, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WwVEv1nkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The BELLA 12 Piece Rocket Blender is perfect for blending, chopping, grinding and more, thanks to its high power base. The 2 stainless steel grinding blades can be used to chop hard foods and grind coffee while the cross blade is able to liquefy solid fruits and vegetables. Making your favorite drinks is quick and easy with a simple one-touch operation. All BPA-free containers and accessories are dishwasher safe, meaning a quicker and easier cleaning process for your busy lifestyle. From the Manufacturer Simplify kitchen prep and make healthy, delicious food and drinks with the compact BELLA 12-Piece Rocket Blender. With two separate blades for grinding and blending, the Rocket Blender easily handles whole fruits and vegetables, spices, nuts, and coffee beans. Whip up a smoothie and drink it right from the blending cup. Designed for streamlined function and cleanup, this blender makes it easy to prepare, serve, and store food with minimal mess. 12-Piece Rocket Blender At a Glance: Blend fruits and vegetables in seconds Blend fruits and vegetables in seconds Grinding blade for coffee, nuts, and spices Grinding blade for coffee, nuts, and spices Simple push-down operation Simple push-down operation Three dishwasher-safe blending cups Three dishwasher-safe blending cups Variety of lids to serve, store, and sip Variety of lids to serve, store, and sip The Rocket Blender is ideal for blending, chopping, grinding and more. Stainless Steel Blades Grind or Blend in Seconds Equipped with two sharp stainless steel blades, the Rocket Blender effectively grinds and emulsifies a variety of foods. The cross blade quickly and thoroughly blends whole vegetables, fruits for smoothies, and more. The flat grinding blade chops seeds, nuts, and spices. You can also use this blade to grind coffee beans to the desired texture and store grounds in an included cup with solid lid. Cups and Lids to Blend, Serve, and Store Foods The Rocket Blender comes with two tall blending cups (21.6 ounces) and one small grinding cup (13.3 ounces), so you can prepare various quantities of food to use or store. Because the blades attach directly to each cup, you can enjoy a blended drink right from the cup you use to prepare it. Four dishwasher-safe (in top rack) lids meet various needs. Two reusable solid lids seal contents to store or transport. A shaker lid with large holes helps you serve grated cheese, chocolate, flavored sugars, or coarse spice blends straight from the grinding cup. The shaker lid with small holes is ideal for sprinkling finely ground spices such as cinnamon stick or nutmeg. The two lip rings screw onto any of the cups so you can sip your drink in comfort and minimize drips. Straightforward Operation and Cleanup To use the Rocket Blender, simply attach the appropriate blade to one of the blending cups, rotate to lock it into the powerful base, and push down to blend. Dishwasher safe cups make cleanup easy. Blends Ingredients for Soups, Sauces, and Other Recipes The Rocket Blender simplifies food prep for many cooking endeavors. Puree soups or mix ingredients for pancake batter, cheesecake, omelets, and more. Sauces, dressings, marinades, and dips come together quickly with little mess. Use the provided recipes or get creative in the kitchen. What's in the Box Motor base, grinding blade, blending blade, two tall blending cups, short blending cup, two comfort lip rings, two reusable lids, two shaker lids, and instruction manual with recipes. Recipe Suggestion: Mango Strawberry Delight A fruity refreshing drink that's easy to blend whenever you want. 4-5 slices of mango 4-5 slices of mango 4-5 strawberries 4-5 strawberries Dash of orange juice Dash of orange juice 1 cup of previously finely crushed ice 1 cup of previously finely crushed ice Combine all the ingredients into the large blending cup. Combine all the ingredients into the large blending cup. Twist cup into base, push down and pulse until a smooth consistency is reached. Twist cup into base, push down and pulse until a smooth consistency is reached. Add cup ring and serve immediately! Add cup ring and serve immediately! High power base Shaker tops and resealable lids Comfort lip rings and stainless steel cross blade and flat blade Tall and short blending cups","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WwVEv1nkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BELLA","source_asin":"B0086WPO3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0086WPO3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0086WPO3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
